      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the original test. I'll write an improved version that:\n1. Removes unused constants (`SWISS_GERMAN_STUFF_UNICODE`, `RUSSIAN_STUFF_UNICODE`) and unused helpers (`constructString`, `validateState`) that add noise without contributing to this test\n2. Adds a clear explanation of what's being tested and why the exception is expectedThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes the three unused members (`SWISS_GERMAN_STUFF_UNICODE`, `RUSSIAN_STUFF_UNICODE`, `constructString`) and the no-op `validateState` helper, and adds concise Javadoc comments explaining *why* the bogus charset triggers each exception type."
